('12-CHE-CK-0011','TS-Inter-2,MPC,BiPC,JEE','Chemistry','Chemical Kinetics','Molecularity','Medium',0,NULL,'Molecularity is','Number of molecules in elementary step','Order','Rate constant','Equilibrium constant','A','Always positive integer (1, 2, or 3).',NULL,1,NOW()),
